					2, 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 24</span></i>
			<i>fin.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut ducere quis posset eos in quos habet jus
					ductionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 43, 30, 3, § 1</span></i>
			.</div>
